1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,400
I was too tired to explain, so I chose silence. You kept asking what was wrong.

2
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:14,720
I kept saying nothing. You heard my words. You never heard my silence. You wanted an explanation.

3
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:21,980
I wanted to be understood. By the time you finally understand me, it might already be too late.
